        // Summary generated from merged content
    }
}
```

### 15.4 Default Timeout Configuration

**Operation-Specific Defaults**:

| Category | Default Timeout | Rationale |
|----------|------------------|-----------|
| **Instant** (<1s) | 1 second | Memory operations, simple calculations |
| **Fast** (1-10s) | **30 seconds** | User preference for file writes, web fetches |
| **Medium** (10-60s) | 60 seconds | Large file ops, web scraping |
| **Slow** (1-10m) | 10 minutes | Code generation, complex analysis |

**Override in YAML**:
```yaml
timespans:
  fast:
    default: 30s  # User preference
  medium:
    default: 60s
```

### 15.5 Agent Spawning Configuration

**Default**: **Require explicit permission** - Agents cannot spawn other agents unless specified

**Rationale**:
- Security: Prevent unauthorized sub-agent creation
- Control: User must explicitly enable spawning capability
- Hierarchical: Top-level agents control spawning

**Schema**:
```yaml
agents:
  - name: controller
    permissions:
      can_spawn: true  # Required to spawn sub-agents
      agent: "all"  # Or specify tool permissions
  - name: worker
    # No can_spawn → cannot spawn sub-agents
```

